  YouTube: 'M23.498 6.186a2.994 2.994 0 0 0-2.107-2.12C19.505 3.5 12 3.5 12 3.5s-7.505 0-9.391.566A2.994 2.994 0 0 0 .502 6.186C0 8.09 0 12 0 12s0 3.91.502 5.814a2.994 2.994 0 0 0 2.107 2.12C4.495 20.5 12 20.5 12 20.5s7.505 0 9.391-.566a2.994 2.994 0 0 0 2.107-2.12C24 15.91 24 12 24 12s0-3.91-.502-5.814ZM9.75 15.5v-7l6.5 3.5-6.5 3.5Z',
